    {"id":"b3-note","type":"text","x":2300,"y":2384,"width":1150,"height":48,"text":"Shows a useful reminder without opening the journey. The preview is text, not a separate checkbox.\nTradeoff: every connection takes more vertical space, even when collapsed.","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":5,"strokeColor":"#52647a"},

    {"id":"bstates-head","type":"text","x":2300,"y":2490,"width":1050,"height":36,"text":"B1 interaction states / desktop and mobile","fontSize":26,"fontFamily":5,"strokeColor":"#172b4d"},
    {"id":"bstates-sub","type":"text","x":2300,"y":2535,"width":1200,"height":48,"text":"Recommended starting point: B1 keeps enough room for long checks on a phone.\nThese details apply to all three alternatives unless noted.","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":5,"strokeColor":"#52647a"},
    {"id":"bs-empty","type":"rectangle","x":2300,"y":2615,"width":335,"height":175,"strokeColor":"#cbd5e1","backgroundColor":"#ffffff","fillStyle":"solid","roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"id":"bs-empty-t","type":"text","x":2318,"y":2632,"width":300,"height":145,"text":"No departure yet\n\nBrussels → Ghent\n+ Add departure\n\nSet date and time first.","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":5,"strokeColor":"#172b4d"},
    {"id":"bs-create","type":"rectangle","x":2660,"y":2615,"width":335,"height":175,"strokeColor":"#78a8dd","backgroundColor":"#f1f7ff","fillStyle":"solid","roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"id":"bs-create-t","type":"text","x":2678,"y":2632,"width":300,"height":145,"text":"New departure\n\nBrussels → Ghent\nDate [ 12 Jun ]   Time [ 09:00 ]\nCancel              Save departure\n\nThen add checks.","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":5,"strokeColor":"#174a88"},
    {"id":"bs-ready","type":"rectangle","x":3020,"y":2615,"width":335,"height":175,"strokeColor":"#8cbda3","backgroundColor":"#edf8f0","fillStyle":"solid","roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"id":"bs-ready-t","type":"text","x":3038,"y":2632,"width":300,"height":145,"text":"All checks resolved\n\nBrussels → Ghent         ∧\nReady / 3 of 3 resolved\n☑  Tickets saved\n−  Keys returned / skipped","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":5,"strokeColor":"#21603e"},
    {"id":"bs-multi","type":"rectangle","x":3380,"y":2615,"width":335,"height":175,"strokeColor":"#cbd5e1","backgroundColor":"#ffffff","fillStyle":"solid","roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"id":"bs-multi-t","type":"text","x":3398,"y":2632,"width":300,"height":145,"text":"Multiple departures\n\nBrussels → Ghent\n12 Jun, 09:00 / 2 left    ›\n12 Jun, 15:00 / Ready    ›\n\nOpen the intended departure.","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":5,"strokeColor":"#172b4d"},
    {"id":"bstates-detail","type":"text","x":2300,"y":2830,"width":1450,"height":125,"text":"Opening a journey expands in place; closing preserves the route position. Checking an item updates the count after save.\nEmpty lists are not ready. Done and skipped stay distinct. Failed saves keep the previous state and offer retry.\nA read-only viewer sees the same journey and checks without edit controls. Family links must not reveal checklist details.\nCheckpoint drag handles move visits only. Reorder or removal may leave departures non-adjacent; behavior needs a decision.","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":5,"strokeColor":"#52647a"},
    {"id":"bdecision","type":"text","x":2300,"y":2990,"width":1500,"height":70,"text":"Open decision: should a named checklist be copied into a departure as a starting point, or linked to it?\nExisting departure checks are independent per journey. Do not silently reset them when the route changes.","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":5,"strokeColor":"#52647a"},

    {"id":"compact-title","type":"text","x":4000,"y":30,"width":1500,"height":42,"text":"B3: a checklist title, fewer words","fontSize":32,"fontFamily":5,"strokeColor":"#172b4d"},
    {"id":"compact-intro","type":"text","x":4000,"y":85,"width":1450,"height":65,"text":"The surrounding checkpoints already identify the transition. The collapsed row names the checklist instead.\nThree compact treatments, shown in the same desktop and mobile route. Titles and counts are examples.","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":5,"strokeColor":"#52647a"},

