    {"id":"tab-behavior-head","type":"text","x":12500,"y":715,"width":950,"height":32,"text":"Interaction","fontSize":24,"fontFamily":5,"strokeColor":"#172b4d"},
    {"id":"tab-behavior","type":"text","x":12500,"y":760,"width":1420,"height":150,"text":"The separate plus closes the picker when pressed again. Escape also closes it and returns focus to the plus.\nClick a row to add a fresh unchecked copy. Add new opens an editable card. The list itself does not edit the source.\nLong names wrap and repeated city visits include their checkpoint numbers. The list scrolls when it grows; the plus stays visible.\nRows and the plus keep at least 44 px targets. The hover fill is paired with a visible keyboard-focus outline.\nIf adding fails, leave the picker open with Retry; do not create duplicates on a lost response.","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":5,"strokeColor":"#52647a"},

    {"id":"color-study-title","type":"text","x":14000,"y":30,"width":1300,"height":40,"text":"Picker color: previous and selected","fontSize":30,"fontFamily":5,"strokeColor":"#172b4d"},
    {"id":"color-study-intro","type":"text","x":14000,"y":85,"width":1300,"height":50,"text":"Same square picker and content. The suggestion uses the app's existing light-blue surfaces.\nHover is shown on the second row; keyboard focus keeps an outline.","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":5,"strokeColor":"#52647a"},
